im haline getirmektedir.</p><hr data-start="975" data-end="978" /><h3 data-start="980" data-end="1022"><strong data-start="984" data-end="1020">DCP 18% Temel Özellikler </strong></h3><ul data-start="1023" data-end="1564"><li data-start="1023" data-end="1080"><p data-start="1025" data-end="1080"><strong data-start="1025" data-end="1050">Toplam Fosfor (P):</strong> ≥18.0% | <strong data-start="1060" data-end="1071">Sonuç:</strong> 18.23%</p></li><li data-start="1081" data-end="1161"><p data-start="1083" data-end="1161"><strong data-start="1083" data-end="1136">Kullanılabilir Fosfor (2% sitrik asit çözünürlüğü):</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1144" data-end="1155">Sonuç:</strong> 99%</p></li><li data-start="1162" data-end="1209"><p data-start="1164" data-end="1209"><strong data-start="1164" data-end="1181">Kalsiyum (Ca):</strong> ≥20% | <strong data-start="1189" data-end="1200">Sonuç:</strong> 22.27%</p></li><li data-start="1210" data-end="1258"><p data-start="1212" data-end="1258"><strong data-start="1212" data-end="1229">Flor (F):</strong> ≤0.18% | <strong data-start="1239" data-end="1250">Sonuç:</strong> 0.15%</p></li><li data-start="1259" data-end="1309"><p data-start="1261" data-end="1309"><strong data-start="1261" data-end="1278">Arsenik (As):</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1289" data-end="1300">Sonuç:</strong> 13 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1310" data-end="1356"><p data-start="1312" data-end="1356"><strong data-start="1312" data-end="1326">Kurşun (Pb):</strong> ≤30 ppm | <strong data-start="1337" data-end="1348">Sonuç:</strong> 7 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1357" data-end="1408"><p data-start="1359" data-end="1408"><strong data-start="1359" data-end="1376">Kadmiyum (Cd):</strong> ≤10 ppm | <strong data-start="1387" data-end="1398">Sonuç:</strong> 1,3 ppm</p></li><li data-start="1409" data-end="1465"><p data-start="1411" data-end="1465"><strong data-start="1411" data-end="1442">pH (2,4 g/L su çözeltisi):</strong> &gt;7 | <strong data-start="1448" data-end="1459">Sonuç:</strong> 7.5</p></li><li data-start="1466" data-end="1504"><p data-start="1468" data-end="1504"><strong data-start="1468" data-end="1481">Nem:</strong> ≤4% | <strong data-start="1488" data-end="1499">Sonuç:</strong> 1%</p></li><li data-start="1505" data-end="1564"><p data-start="1507" data-end="1564"><strong data-start="1507" data-end="1539">Parçacık boyutu (500 μm'yi geçer):</strong> ≥90% | <strong data-start="1547" data-end="1558">Sonuç:</strong> 95%</p></li></ul><hr data-start="1566" data-end="1569" /><h3 data-start="980" data-end="1022"><img src="/images/uploads/2025/09/DCP18-Powder-4-300x300.jpg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-516 size-medium" alt="(DCP) Dikalsiyum Fosfat 18% Toz - Yem Sınıfı" width="300" height="300" /></h3><hr data-start="2207" data-end="2210" /><h3 data-start="2212" data-end="2234"><strong data-start="2216" data-end="2232">Uygulamalar</strong></h3><ul data-start="2235" data-end="2663"><li data-start="2235" data-end="2353"><p data-start="2237" data-end="2353"><strong data-start="2237" data-end="2253">Kümes Hayvanları Yemi</strong> - Yumurta kabuğu mukavemetini artırır, broylerlerde hızlı büyümeyi destekler ve yumurtlama performansını artırır.</p></li><li data-start="2354" data-end="2470"><p data-start="2356" data-end="2470"><strong data-start="2356" data-end="2374">Hayvancılık Yemi</strong> - Sığır, domuz, koyun ve keçilerde kemik gücünü, kilo alımını ve yem verimliliğini destekler.</p></li><li data-start="2471" data-end="2561"><p data-start="2473" data-end="2561"><strong data-start="2473" data-end="2488">Akuakültür</strong> - Balık ve karideslerin büyümesi ve hayatta kalması için gerekli mineralleri sağlar.</p></li><li data-start="2562" data-end="2663"><p data-start="2564" data-end="2663"><strong data-start="2564" data-end="2581">Evcil Hayvan Beslenmesi</strong> - Köpekler, kediler ve diğer evcil hayvanlar için dengeli mineral takviyesi.</p></li></ul><hr data-start="2665" data-end="2668" /><h3